<section class="faq" id="faq">
  <h2 class="section-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

  <div class="faq__list">
    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary class="faq-question">
        How is this different from every other self-help book?
        <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        </span>
      </summary>
      <p class="faq-answer">Most books coddle you with theory and feel-good stories. This one doesn't. It's straightforward, focused on the principles that build grit and the exact drills to install them in your life.</p>
    </details>

    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary class="faq-question">
        Is it practical or just theory?
        <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        </span>
      </summary>
      <p class="faq-answer">Both. Every chapter breaks down a specific principle paired with practical steps. It gives you a direct breakdown and exactly what to do about it.</p>
    </details>

    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary class="faq-question">
        How long is the book?
        <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        </span>
      </summary>
      <p class="faq-answer">Every chapter is short and brutal — no filler. You can read it in a weekend, but the stories will sit with you a lot longer than that.</p>
    </details>

    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary class="faq-question">
        What format is it?
        <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        </span>
      </summary>
      <p class="faq-answer">eBook (PDF) or physical paperback, shipped worldwide. Read the eBook on your phone, tablet, computer, or e-reader with instant access. Or hold the physical copy in your hands — your call.</p>
    </details>

    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary class="faq-question">
          Do you ship to my country?
        <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        </span>
      </summary>
      <p class="faq-answer">We ship worldwide. We guarantee free shipping if you're in the US. Everywhere else, there might be a shipping fee calculated at checkout.</p>
    </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
      <summary class="faq-question">
        Do you have contact info if something goes wrong?
        <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        </span>
      </summary>
      <p class="faq-answer">Yes. If you have any issues, email us anytime at {{ book.contactEmail }} and we'll sort it out.</p>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>
